RISCV ISA2
"Naive RVWMO lowering (scopes erased) of tests/litmus/ptx/imported/mixedproxy/ISA2.litmus"
{
0:x5=x; 0:x6=flag1; 1:x5=flag1; 1:x6=flag2; 2:x5=flag2; 2:x6=x;
}
